   "title": "Paint solutions provider Techno Paints plans Rs 500-crore IPO, files draft papers with SEBI",
   "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5"
  }
 ],
 "synopsis": "Paint solutions provider Technopaints and Chemicals has filed draft papers with SEBI to raise Rs 500 crore through an initial public offering. The IPO comprises a fresh issue of shares worth Rs 325 crore and an offer-for-sale worth Rs 175 crore by existing shareholders, including promoters Akuri Srinivasa Reddy and his wife, A Sandhya. The company may also consider raising up to Rs 65 crore in a pre-IPO round. Anand Rathi Advisors is the sole merchant banker managing the issue. Net proceeds from the fresh issue will be utilized to set up a greenfield manufacturing and innovation facility, fund working capital requirements, and for general corporate purposes.",
